      "notes": "Table 3 gives the word-internal quantity and manner contrasts read here: the ˈVːC vs ˈVCː contrast, the long consonants [pː tː kː fː mː nː rː sː] (krabba, skadda, sagga, kaffi, klemmu, manna, marra, massa), and the preaspirated [ʰp ʰt ʰk] (krappa, skatta, sakka) which pattern with geminates in shortening the vowel but are not themselves long."
